{"duration": 17.11, "cues": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 5.58, "text": "After the first attacks, single sharks\nstayed away for weeks. Later, the gaps"}, {"start": 5.58, "end": 12.0, "text": "grew to months. Sightings kept dropping\nfor two and a half years. On many days"}, {"start": 12.0, "end": 17.11, "text": "the boats went out and came back\nwithout seeing a single great white."}], "words": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.32, "text": "After"}, {"start": 0.32, "end": 0.48, "text": "the"}, {"start": 0.48, "end": 0.72, "text": "first"}, {"start": 0.72, "end": 1.28, "text": "attacks,"}, {"start": 1.96, "end": 2.0, "text": "single"}, {"start": 2.0, "end": 2.4, "text": "sharks"}, {"start": 2.4, "end": 2.78, "text": "stayed"}, {"start": 2.78, "end": 3.12, "text": "away"}, {"start": 3.12, "end": 3.4, "text": "for"}, {"start": 3.4, "end": 3.82, "text": "weeks."}, {"start": 4.34, "end": 4.72, "text": "Later,"}, {"start": 5.1, "end": 5.26, "text": "the"}, {"start": 5.26, "end": 5.58, "text": "gaps"}, {"start": 5.58, "end": 5.9, "text": "grew"}, {"start": 5.9, "end": 6.14, "text": "to"}, {"start": 6.14, "end": 6.56, "text": "months."}, {"start": 7.24, "end": 7.56, "text": "Sightings"}, {"start": 7.56, "end": 7.84, "text": "kept"}, {"start": 7.84, "end": 8.38, "text": "dropping"}, {"start": 8.38, "end": 8.7, "text": "for"}, {"start": 8.7, "end": 9.0, "text": "two"}, {"start": 9.0, "end": 9.14, "text": "and"}, {"start": 9.14, "end": 9.28, "text": "a"}, {"start": 9.28, "end": 9.52, "text": "half"}, {"start": 9.52, "end": 10.0, "text": "years."}, {"start": 10.54, "end": 10.72, "text": "On"}, {"start": 10.72, "end": 11.04, "text": "many"}, {"start": 11.04, "end": 11.58, "text": "days"}, {"start": 12.0, "end": 12.08, "text": "the"}, {"start": 12.08, "end": 12.36, "text": "boats"}, {"start": 12.36, "end": 12.68, "text": "went"}, {"start": 12.68, "end": 13.1, "text": "out"}, {"start": 13.1, "end": 13.56, "text": "and"}, {"start": 13.56, "end": 13.84, "text": "came"}, {"start": 13.84, "end": 14.